    <briefdescription>
<para>This struct defines the shadow mapping using the rule: shadow = (mem &gt;&gt; Scale) ADD-or-OR Offset. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>If InGlobal is true, then extern char __asan_shadow[]; shadow = (mem &gt;&gt; Scale) + &amp;__asan_shadow </para>
